# The /docs mirror produced by `npm run build:docs`.
#
# The primary deploy path is GitHub Actions serving the repository root, which needs no
# mirror at all, so committing one would just put a second copy of the whole codebase in
# git. If you switch Pages to "Deploy from a branch -> /docs" instead, delete these four
# lines, run `npm run build:docs`, and commit the result.
